  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;be&nbsp;the&nbsp;solution curves the&nbsp;differential equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></math> with initial&nbsp;conditions&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> respectively. Then the curves&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> intersect at</p>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "no point",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "two points",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "one point",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "infinite number of points",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>We have been given that<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>|</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>|</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>.</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></math></p><p>Hence, No point of intersection.</p><p>This is the required option.</p></blockquote>"
  }
